73
00:07:32.478 --> 00:07:33.310
<i>"The Bride
with White Hair"?</i>

74
00:07:33.311 --> 00:07:35.393
Yeah. that's
actually very good.

75
00:07:35.394 --> 00:07:37.858
Oh!
- Ow! Punk.

